1
00:00:00,890 --> 00:00:03,760
(Amy:)Bernadette is with
Priya and Leonard.

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:06,230
(Amy:)Message received.

3
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:10,430
(Amy:)Commence operation
"Priya Wouldn't Wanna Be-ya."

4
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:13,780
(Penny:)Hey. Seriously?

5
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:16,470
(Penny:)Didn't you get enough of this
cliquey crap in high school?

6
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:18,500
(Amy:)I wish. A clique
requires friends.

7
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:21,040
(Amy:)- I didn't have any.
- None?

8
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:23,340
(Amy:)I used to take my lunch
down to the maintenance room

9
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,550
(Amy:)and eat with the janitor.

10
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:28,010
It was nice until his wife
called me a puta

11
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:29,450
(Amy:)and made me stop.

12
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:35,190
(Amy:)Hang on.

13
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:37,590
(Amy:)It's the wildebeest.

14
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:40,260
(Amy:)Priya just made a snide comment
about your acting career.

15
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,130
W-What the hell did she say?

16
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:44,200
(Amy:)She thinks it's cool
you're following your dream,

17
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:46,100
(Amy:)no matter what.

18
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:49,540
(Penny:)That bitch!

19
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:52,270
(Amy:)How do you want
to handle it?

20
00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:54,110
(Penny:)Um, okay.

21
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:57,080
(Penny:)Tell Bernadette to tell Priya
that I'm on my way to Prague

22
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:59,610
(Penny:)to shoot a movie
with Angelina Jolie.

23
00:00:59,610 --> 00:01:01,310
(Leonard:)Got it.

